<title>UK: NYNEX launches new UK phone package.</title>
<headline>NYNEX launches new UK phone package.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>NYNEX CableComms Group Plc said on Monday it was launching a new package for UK residential phone customers which it claimed offered total savings of more than 30 percent over British Telecom standard inland prices.</p>
<p>The NYNEX Select package will offer a further 10 percent reduction on NYNEX call charges made to regular residential customers, cheaper number portability and the installation of a second line, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>It will cost 1.45 stg per month.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
